00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Dr. Kotri provides oversight and guidance on blended primary care and behavioral health services within the organization. In addition, she trains, consults, and presents extensively on integrated care. Thank you for joining us, Dr. Katri. Thank you very much. We hear a lot today about integrated health care. Are patient-centered health care and integrated health care the same thing? Well, they certainly are related, but they are not the same thing.
科特里博士负责监督和指导该组织内的混合初级保健和行为健康服务。此外，她还就综合护理进行了广泛的培训、咨询和演讲。感谢您加入我们，科特里博士。非常感谢。我们今天经常听到综合医疗保健。以患者为中心的医疗保健和综合医疗保健是一回事吗？嗯，它们当然是相关的，但它们不是一回事。

