00:02:17.000 --> 00:03:02.000
health behaviors, including their contribution to chronic medical illness, life stressors, crises, stress-related physical symptoms, health care utilization. So, for example, what is a patient-centered medical home? So a patient-centered medical home is a model of care that focuses on concepts of, of course, number one, patient-centered care in which the patient is really a partner with their health care team. The care is also comprehensive, and that means that all of the patient's health care needs, including lifestyle management, prevention, wellness, as well as chronic and acute conditions,
健康行为，包括它们对慢性内科疾病、生活压力源、危机、压力相关的身体症状、医疗保健利用的影响。那么，例如，什么是“以患者为中心的医疗之家”？以患者为中心的医疗之家是一种护理模式，它关注的核心概念当然首先是以患者为中心的护理，在这种护理中，患者确实是其医疗团队的合作伙伴。护理也是全面的，这意味着患者所有的医疗保健需求，包括生活方式管理、预防、健康，以及慢性病和急性病，

