elements of the broader healthcare system are coordinated within this patient-centered home. And then certainly quality and safety is emphasized that because the patient-centered medical home is such a core part and almost a cornerstone in someone's health care, we really want to make sure that it is of the highest quality possible and that it's safe. So I have a primary care physician. Does that mean my care is being delivered in a patient-centered care model? It's certainly a first step to getting patient-centered care is to have a primary care physician. But, again, the core elements of how the care is provided, is it being patients, is it really engaging you as a partner?
更广泛医疗保健系统的要素都在这个以患者为中心的家中得到协调。当然，质量和安全也受到强调，因为以患者为中心的医疗之家是某人医疗保健的核心部分，几乎是基石，我们确实希望确保它是尽可能高质量且安全的。那么，我有初级保健医生。这是否意味着我的护理是以患者为中心的护理模式提供的？拥有初级保健医生当然是获得以患者为中心护理的第一步。但是，同样，护理提供方式的核心要素是，它是否以患者为中心，是否真的让您作为合作伙伴参与其中？

