00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:56.000
Is it comprehensive? Is it coordinated? Do you have easy access to your provider 24 hours a day, seven days a week? Is there a strong commitment to quality and safety? All of those components have to be there. So having a primary care physician is certainly the first step, but it's not the only step in getting good patient-centered care. You know, patient-centered care is sometimes referred to as patient-and-family-centered health care.
它全面吗？它协调吗？您是否能24小时、每周7天轻松联系到您的医疗服务提供者？对质量和安全是否有坚定的承诺？所有这些组成部分都必须具备。因此，拥有初级保健医生当然是第一步，但它不是获得良好以患者为中心护理的唯一一步。你知道，以患者为中心的护理有时被称为“以患者和家庭为中心的医疗保健”。

