00:04:56.000 --> 00:05:41.000
You know, why is that? People have begun to realize that patients, individuals don't live in isolation, that we all have social networks and partnerships and relationships that are incredibly important to us. Not only are they important to us personally, they're important to our health. Many of us live with other people. We live perhaps with our parents, siblings, partners, children, extended family, friends. All of these people construct a very important social network that has a very strong impact on any person, overall health status. Let's talk about some particularly pressing health conditions, you know, obesity
你知道，为什么会这样？人们已经开始意识到，患者、个人并不是孤立生活的，我们都有对我们极其重要的社会网络、伙伴关系和人际关系。它们不仅对我们个人很重要，对我们的健康也很重要。我们许多人与他人住在一起。我们可能与父母、兄弟姐妹、伴侣、孩子、大家庭成员、朋友住在一起。所有这些人构成了一个非常重要的社会网络，对任何人的整体健康状况都有非常强烈的影响。让我们谈谈一些特别紧迫的健康状况，你知道，肥胖

