00:08:17.000 --> 00:09:07.000
to make sure that they're available to us whenever we feel like we're not doing as well, that's going to, of course, create a much better environment for addressing these two very dangerous health conditions. Now, the health system you work in, Cherokee Health System, is a leader in providing patient-centered care. Can you tell us about how that works? So Cherokee Health Systems is a federally qualified health center and a community mental health center. We have a clinical service delivery model that has a paradigm of integrated health care services. And what that means on the ground is that when people come to our clinic, In fact, even when they call in, all of their health care needs are assessed.
确保在我们觉得做得不够好时他们能随时为我们提供帮助，这当然会创造一个更好的环境来解决这两种非常危险的健康状况。现在，您工作的卫生系统，切诺基卫生系统，是提供以患者为中心护理的领导者。你能告诉我们它是如何运作的吗？切诺基卫生系统是一家联邦合格的健康中心和社区心理健康中心。我们有一个临床服务交付模式，它有一个综合医疗保健服务的范式。这意味着在实际操作中，当人们来到我们的诊所时，事实上，即使当他们打电话进来时，他们所有的医疗保健需求都会得到评估。

